  "prefLabel": "Tre 219.02 Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 219.02 Notice. If examination of the petition reveals that the proposed relief may substantially affect other persons, the treasurer shall require the petitioner to provide notice to those persons. The treasury shall afford affected persons the opportunity for hearing prior to ruling on the request for waiver.\n\nSource. #9575-B, eff 10-22-09, EXPIRED: 10-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre200.html"
